# This repo is public. The list below is an ALLOWLIST: ignore everything at the
# top level, then re-include only what the published site needs. Anything new
# stays private until it is added here on purpose.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/build.py
!/src/
!/public/
!/.github/

# Private notes, even inside tracked folders: CLAUDE.md, docs/, folder READMEs.
# Page content is .html, so no published file is ever markdown.
*.md

# Secrets. Nothing needs one yet; a form service key would.
.env
.env.*

# Build output. GitHub Actions rebuilds it on every push.
_site/
__pycache__/

# Mac and editor clutter
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.swp
